ngs so you run"},{"t":77.5,"txt":"something really low like this now with"},{"t":79.4,"txt":"a low setting you have to use quite a"},{"t":81.1,"txt":"bit of gun manipulation to fill out that"},{"t":83.2,"txt":"fillet weld this is like what you do"},{"t":85.7,"txt":"pretty often in Motorsports or things"},{"t":87.6,"txt":"like that um where you see those uh"},{"t":89.9,"txt":"ripples they they Ripple out a lot more"},{"t":91.8,"txt":"on thicker like/ quinch thick material"},{"t":94.2,"txt":"on 8 in like this it's a bit more of a"},{"t":96,"txt":"challenge to get that same look but uh"},{"t":98.7,"txt":"it's still somewhat doable so that's"},{"t":101.4,"txt":"what we're running here now notice that"},{"t":103.8,"txt":"I'm right around 80 amps on the left"},{"t":106.6,"txt":"display there on the machine and 17.3"},{"t":109.3,"txt":"volts over on the right and over on the"},{"t":112.8,"txt":"left side of the screen you can see the"},{"t":114.6,"txt":"thermal imaging results where it's"},{"t":116.6,"txt":"really bright right behind the Weld and"},{"t":118.6,"txt":"then out from that you can see how much"},{"t":121.4,"txt":"that heat soaks out into the material"},{"t":125,"txt":"all right for that weld it ran at about"},{"t":128.2,"txt":"80 amps and 17.3 volts so that's right"},{"t":131.9,"txt":"around 1,400 Watts kind of like a hair"},{"t":134.2,"txt":"dryer on low and it took 42 seconds to"},{"t":138.6,"txt":"run that weld for a total of 58 K of"},{"t":142.8,"txt":"energy that went into the weld now let's"},{"t":146.2,"txt":"go ahead and run with some higher"},{"t":148,"txt":"settings I'll turn that wire feed speed"},{"t":150,"txt":"voltage up and we'll see how that does"},{"t":153.5,"txt":"okay I'm going to use a push technique"},{"t":155.9,"txt":"here I could use a drag technique also"},{"t":157.7,"txt":"but I'm not doing any kind of"},{"t":158.6,"txt":"manipulation I'm just moving the"},{"t":160.1,"txt":"straight line across the whole joint"},{"t":162.4,"txt":"here a